#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:1
msgid "Maintain Modelo 036 census facts in your profile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use this guide to keep your AEAT census facts - the {term}`censo` - "
"correct in the active local profile. In Spain, the censo is tied to "
"Modelo 036 registration and changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:7
msgid ""
"This guide covers Modelo 036. Modelo 037 is superseded and not used in "
"this workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:10
msgid ""
"You enter census facts by hand. The tool does not read your censo from "
"AEAT: AEAT publishes no read-only census view, and the only sede surface "
"that shows census data is the census *modification* tool, which this "
"application never operates. The tool does not file Modelo 036, does not "
"submit changes to AEAT, and does not modify AEAT records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:16
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:18
msgid "You need:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:20
msgid ""
"an active taxpayer profile; see [Set up your taxpayer profile](profile-"
"setup.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:21
msgid "the taxpayer's fiscal ID (NIF, CIF, DNI, or NIE) saved in that profile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:22
msgid ""
"your censo facts as AEAT holds them: activity description and start date,"
" tax regime, IVA regime, and enrollment facts. Read them from your Modelo"
" 036 copy or from the AEAT sede."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:26
msgid ""
"Every command on this page needs your master-key passphrase; the tool "
"prompts for it. The tool's messages are in Spanish."
msgstr ""

