msgid "Keep the facts current"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/censo-update.md:104
msgid ""
"Your AEAT census can change - a new activity, a regime change, a baja. "
"The application cannot detect that drift. Re-check the profile against "
"your latest Modelo 036 copy whenever you file a censo change, and before "
"you plan a new filing year."
msgstr ""

